graph TD
  P[Plan written] --> PF[Preflight<br/>feature branch, delivery.json exists,<br/>run.sh start: hooks guard the run]
  PF --> G[Questions for the human<br/>numbered, each with a recommended answer<br/>answers go into the plan file]
  G --> A{Approve the cut?<br/>name, risk, size, criteria, exercise line}
  A -- no --> G
  A -- go, or long --> S1[1. Snapshot before the chunk]
  S1 --> I[2. Implementers, one per task<br/>model by risk, report ends with Proof and Reuse]
  I --> SG{3. Snapshot after, then static gate<br/>test lock, drift, secrets,<br/>commands from delivery.json, reuse flags}
  SG -- fails, 2 static rounds at most --> I
  SG -- clean, low risk --> REP
  SG -- clean --> R[4. Review against rubrics<br/>5. Fix rounds, 3 or 5 at most]
  R --> V[6. Verify seat<br/>runs the exercise line and criteria<br/>runs each Proof claim again]
  V -- FAIL --> R
  V -- done, high risk --> M[7. Cross-model review]
  M --> REP
  V -- done --> REP[8. Chunk report<br/>Files, Changed, Proof, Verified,<br/>Fixed, Parked, Reuse, Cross]
  REP --> W{9. Human says<br/>next / fix / map / redo / stop}
  W -- next --> S1
  W -- fix --> REP
  W -- last chunk approved --> T[Verify every acceptance criterion]
  T --> TR[Whole-tree review, then cross-model]
  TR --> FR[Final report with Spec line]
  FR --> H[Handoff, run.sh stop<br/>working tree, nothing committed]
  W -- stop --> H
